{
  "declaredLength": 2108,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "你为什么会追求强大呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E3A4EC04E484F1A8FFD6C425F3A59275462FF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是为了自己。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F4E3A4E8681EA5DF1300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是为了保护沐净，\n以及为了保护大家，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n才会追求强大。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F4E3A4E864FDD62A46C9051C0FF0C000A4EE553CA4E3A4E864FDD62A459275BB6FF0C00100001BE00000A624D4F1A8FFD6C425F3A5927300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我确实还没能打败由紫。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211786E5B9E8FD86CA180FD62538D2575317D2B300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但这样的逆境会让我变得更强。\n因为我拥有信念。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F468FD968377684900658834F1A8BA9621153D85F9766F45F3A3002000A56E04E3A621162E567094FE15FF5300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果能够超越由紫，\n我就会觉得自己不会输给任何人。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n为了达到这样的心境，我要不停地战斗。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C80FD591F8D858D8A75317D2BFF0C000A62115C314F1A89C95F9781EA5DF14E0D4F1A8F937ED94EFB4F554EBA300200100001BE00000A4E3A4E868FBE52308FD9683776845FC35883FF0C621189814E0D505C573062186597300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你说到底\n都是为了自己而战啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F608BF452305E95000A90FD662F4E3A4E8681EA5DF1800C6218554A300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身为宝可梦训练家，\n这种想法真的正确吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB4E3A5B9D53EF68A68BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A8FD979CD60F36CD5771F76846B63786E5417FF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这边这边。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD98FB98FD98FB9300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要把你拉进来，\n结束他们的战斗。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118981628A4F6062C98FDB6765FF0C000A7ED3675F4ED64EEC768462186597300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>在这里。\n就用对战来决定哪边才是正确的好了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000057288FD991CC3002000A5C3175285BF96218676551B35B9A54EA8FB9624D662F6B63786E7684597D4E86300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要追求强大的话，\n比起嘴上的功夫，对战要更为实在吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818FFD6C425F3A592776848BDDFF0C000A6BD48D7756344E0A7684529F592BFF0C5BF96218898166F44E3A5B9E57285427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！为了证明我的信念，\n跟我一起和正义社对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF014E3A4E868BC1660E621176844FE15FF5FF0C000A8DDF62114E008D77548C6B634E49793E5BF962185427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也希望能来场对决！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F5E0C671B80FD6765573A5BF951B3FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想回去，\n所以想对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F356DE53BBFF0C000A62404EE560F35BF96218300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有些经验是必须战胜\n强劲的对手之后才能获得的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E9B7ECF9A8C662F5FC5987B621880DC000A5F3A52B276845BF9624B4E4B540E624D80FD83B75F977684300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "力，即是力量！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "529BFF0C5373662F529B91CFFF01FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想不到你还挺优柔寡断的？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F34E0D52304F608FD8633A4F1867D45BE165AD7684FF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "力，即是正义！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "529BFF0C5373662F6B634E49FF01FF0100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！为了证明我的信念，\n跟我一起和正义社对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF014E3A4E868BC1660E621176844FE15FF5FF0C000A8DDF62114E008D77548C6B634E49793E5BF962185427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "列阵兵！通过超级进化\n伸张正义，获取胜利吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "521796355175FF01901A8FC78D857EA78FDB5316000A4F385F206B634E49FF0C83B753D680DC52295427FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水晶灯火灵……\n超级进化，打倒他们！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C346676706F706B707520262026000A8D857EA78FDB5316FF0C625350124ED64EECFF0100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拿出我们的看家本领！\n超级进化，大闹一场咯，毒藻龙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62FF51FA62114EEC7684770B5BB6672C9886FF01000A8D857EA78FDB5316FF0C592795F94E00573A54AFFF0C6BD285FB9F99FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为自己而战，\n为他人而战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A81EA5DF1800C6218FF0C000A4E3A4ED64EBA800C6218300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "两者之间没有什么优劣之分。\n不，似乎都不该拿来比较。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2480054E4B95F46CA167094EC04E484F1852A34E4B52063002000A4E0DFF0C4F3C4E4E90FD4E0D8BE562FF67656BD48F83300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊！你通过保护别人\n而能达到的心境，也一定很棒！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554AFF014F60901A8FC74FDD62A4522B4EBA000A800C80FD8FBE523076845FC35883FF0C4E5F4E005B9A5F8868D2FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我非常感动。\n请收下这套服装。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211975E5E38611F52A83002000A8BF765364E0B8FD95957670D88C5300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在我从由紫那里获得自由之前，\n说好了要一直穿现在这套衣服的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572862114ECE75317D2B90A391CC83B75F9781EA75314E4B524DFF0C000A8BF4597D4E8689814E0076F47A7F73B057288FD959578863670D7684300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好吧。\n那我就送给<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D54273002000A90A362115C3190017ED90010000201000000300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>获得了另一种颜色的\n皙白装扮修行套装！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000083B75F974E8653E64E0079CD989C82727684000A7699767D88C5626E4FEE884C595788C5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说也有好事的人\n会把发型搞得像皙白一样。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF44E5F6709597D4E8B76844EBA000A4F1A628A53D1578B641E5F9750CF7699767D4E006837300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "追求强大是永无止境的。\n有机会的话，再来对决吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FFD6C425F3A5927662F6C3865E06B62588376843002000A6709673A4F1A76848BDDFF0C518D67655BF951B35427300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有一种说法是，\n春紫比我更适合道场。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E0079CD8BF46CD5662FFF0C000A66257D2B6BD4621166F4900254089053573A300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总感觉小时候好像和皙白\n用格斗技对决过……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B611F89C95C0F65F65019597D50CF548C7699767D000A7528683C659762805BF951B38FC72026202600100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    }
  ],
